paragraph('With the formation abundance and $\\eta_*$ fixed,',r'With the formation abundance and $\eta_*$ fixed, the assembly-and-mixing model has five cosmological parameters against six for $\Lambda$CDM. The composition-preserving exponential background and direct geodesic perturbations, with linear lensing and $A_L=1$, give $\chi^2=2227.801$ against $2228.316$, at $f=0.274245$ and $H_0=68.9389\,\mathrm{km\,s^{-1}\,Mpc^{-1}}$. The fits are statistically competitive. Appendix~O.12 specifies the matched likelihood and distinguishes the archived linear-depletion PPF integral $I_{\rm rel}=94.2116$ used by the hydrodynamic comparison. The retention gate, independently measured mixing kernel, nonlinear response, and separate sound-horizon proposal remain physical tests.')
