paragraph('The companion project uses Lean 4.35.0',r'The companion project uses Lean 4.35.0 with a pinned mathlib revision. The audited upstream library has 154 modules and 2{,}812 theorem constants, including the 727-theorem legacy sublibrary. Its audit permits only \texttt{propext}, \texttt{Classical.choice}, and \texttt{Quot.sound}, with no admitted proofs, custom axioms, or \texttt{native\_decide}. Counts include helper results; the manuscript-level scope is recorded separately in the claim ledger.')
